Note on screenshots.
The screenshots show the public website of the Antidiskriminierungsstelle des
Bundes and the official German statute portal, included for documentation so
each step is easy to recognise. Trademarks and site content shown remain with
their respective owners. This repository is independent and is not affiliated
with, operated by, or endorsed by those bodies. To request removal of a
screenshot, please open an issue.
